	"FriendlyName": "DIVE - Device Interactive View Explorer",
	"Description": "Modal detailed inspection and maintenance sessions for complex devices. Orbit camera, authored viewpoints, in-session context menu, and physical proxy controls. DIVERuntime is self-contained (no ACTS or MESS). Physical-mode GRIP grab lives in the sibling plugin DIVEGRIPBridge (enable separately).",
